@base = http://localhost:5080/api/keyboards/Apex%20Pro%20Gen%203/mappings

### Read all 92 keys
GET {{base}}

### Remap A to Z and 4 to 2
PATCH {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mappings": [ { "source": 4, "target": 29 }, { "source": 33, "target": 31 } ] }

### Reset A to its default
PATCH {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mappings": [ { "source": 4, "target": 4 } ] }

### Invalid: 45 (0x2D) is not a key on this keyboard
PATCH {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mappings": [ { "source": 45, "target": 4 } ] }

### Reset every key
DELETE {{base}}
